---
title: Our Story — GÜTE Food Co.
description: "Two food safety pros who flip it over. Most of us don't eat enough fiber — so we put it in something you already reach for."
activePage: story
permalink: /story.html
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block styles %}
<style>
    nav { background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(22,10,4,0.2), transparent); }
    .nav-link.active { opacity: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(240,230,208,0.5); padding-bottom: 2px; }

    .page-hero { min-height: 68vh; background: var(--chocolate); display: flex; flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2.5rem; padding: 8rem 3rem 5rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-seal { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 168px; height: 168px; border-radius: 50%; background: url('/images/pageHeaders/gute-seal.jpg') center / cover; box-shadow: 0 10px 34px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease 0.35s both; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .hero-seal { width: 110px; height: 110px; } }
    .page-hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 60% at 10% 80%, rgba(107,48,128,0.22) 0%, transparent 65%), radial-gradient(ellipse 35% 40% at 90% 10%, rgba(176,32,32,0.1) 0%, transparent 55%); }
    .page-hero-inner { max-width: 820px; position: relative; }
    .page-eyebrow { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.5em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grain); opacity: 0.68; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both; }
    .page-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 6rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--parchment); line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 2rem; animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.1s both; }
    .page-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--berry-pink); }
    .page-lead { font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem); color: var(--grain-light); opacity: 0.72; max-width: 560px; line-height: 1.75; animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease 0.2s both; font-weight: 400; }

    .content-wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 7rem 3rem; }
    .section-stamp { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.56rem; letter-spacing: 0.45em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--stamp); margin-bottom: 2.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
    .section-stamp::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border); max-width: 100px; }
    .prose { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text-body); line-height: 2.0; font-weight: 400; }
    .prose p + p { margin-top: 1.6rem; }
    .prose strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--dark); }
    .problem-block { margin-bottom: 5.5rem; }
    .pull-line { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.35; margin: 3.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.75rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--stamp); }
    .pull-line em { font-style: italic; color: var(--berry-pink); }
    .founders-block { margin-bottom: 5.5rem; }
    .founders-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; margin: 2.5rem 0; }
    .founder-card { background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 2.25rem 2rem; }
    .founder-initial { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 4rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--stamp); opacity: 0.18; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .founder-name { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .founder-role { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.52rem; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--stamp); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .founder-certs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.38rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .cert { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.5rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--text-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 2px; }
    .founder-bio { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.78; }
    .name-block { margin-bottom: 5.5rem; }
    .name-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; margin: 2.5rem 0; }
    .name-card { border-radius: 4px; padding: 2.25rem 2rem; }
    .name-card.dark { background: var(--blueberry); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
    .name-card.light { background: var(--cream); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .name-word { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 3.2rem; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .name-card.dark .name-word { color: var(--parchment); }
    .name-card.light .name-word { color: var(--dark); }
    .name-card.light .name-word em { font-style: normal; color: var(--stamp); }
    .name-sub { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.54rem; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
    .name-card.dark .name-sub { color: var(--grain); opacity: 0.55; }
    .name-card.light .name-sub { color: var(--stamp); }
    .name-desc { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.75; }
    .name-card.dark .name-desc { color: rgba(240,230,208,0.58); }
    .name-card.light .name-desc { color: var(--text-mid); }
    .big-line { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5.5vw, 3.8rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--dark); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .big-line em { font-style: italic; color: var(--berry-pink); }
    .big-line sup { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; }
    .big-line sup a { color: var(--stamp); text-decoration: none; }
    .beats { list-style: none; margin: 2.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .beats li { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.6vw, 1.7rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--dark); padding: 1.1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; align-items: baseline; }
    .beats li span { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.56rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--stamp); flex-shrink: 0; width: 2.2rem; }
    .kicker { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--stamp); margin-top: 2.5rem; }
    .cta-sign { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grain); opacity: 0.6; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .product-block { margin-bottom: 5.5rem; }
    .good-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1px; background: var(--border); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; margin: 2.5rem 0 3rem; }
    .good-cell { background: var(--cream); padding: 1.75rem; }
    .good-word { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--dark); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .good-word em { font-style: italic; color: var(--stamp); }
    .good-detail { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.68; }
    .bridge { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; padding: 2.5rem; background: var(--chocolate); border-radius: 4px; }
    .bridge-label { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.54rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grain); opacity: 0.55; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .bridge-headline { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--parchment); line-height: 1.3; }
    .bridge-headline em { font-style: italic; color: var(--berry-pink); }
    .bridge-link { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--parchment); background: var(--stamp); text-decoration: none; padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; transition: background 0.25s; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .bridge-link:hover { background: #8C1818; }
    .story-cta { background: var(--dark); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4rem 3rem; text-align: center; }
    .cta-eyebrow { font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.56rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--stamp); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .cta-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--parchment); line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    .cta-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--berry-pink); }
    .cta-btn { display: inline-block; font-family: 'Courier Prime', monospace; font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--parchment); background: var(--stamp); text-decoration: none; padding: 1rem 2.5rem; border-radius: 2px; transition: background 0.25s; }
    .cta-btn:hover { background: #8C1818; }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
        .nav-links { gap: 1.5rem; }
        .page-hero { padding: 7rem 1.5rem 4rem; }
        .content-wrap { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }
        .founders-grid, .name-grid, .good-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .bridge { flex-direction: column; }
    }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
        <p class="page-eyebrow">Our Story / Why GÜTE</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">We're the ones who<br><em>flip it over.</em></h1>
        <p class="page-lead">Two food safety pros. 20 years of reading labels. One snack we'd actually eat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-seal" role="img" aria-label="GÜTE seal — good for your gut, good for our planet"></div>
</section>

<div class="content-wrap">
    <div class="problem-block reveal">
        <p class="section-stamp">The Problem</p>
        <h2 class="big-line">Most of us don't eat enough fiber.<br><em>We didn't either.</em><sup><a href="https://med.stanford.edu/news/insights/2026/06/fiber-facts-science-how-much-do-you-need.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Source: Stanford Medicine">[1]</a></sup></h2>
        <div class="prose">
            <p>You're craving a snack. You grab a bar, flip it over, and half the list is stuff you can't pronounce. Nobody has time to look that up in the aisle.</p>
            <p>We do. We've spent <strong>20 years in food safety</strong>, and a lot of those ingredients don't need to be there.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pull-line">So we made a snack <em>for people like us.</em><br>The ones who flip it over.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-block reveal">
        <p class="section-stamp">The Question</p>
        <h2 class="big-line">How do you get more fiber in <em>without asking anyone to change how they eat?</em></h2>
        <div class="prose"><p>Put it in something you already reach for.</p></div>
        <ul class="beats">
            <li><span>01</span>Dark chocolate.</li>
            <li><span>02</span>A crunchy core of seven ancient grains &amp; seeds.</li>
            <li><span>03</span>Fiber from six different sources.</li>
            <li><span>04</span>Pea + rice protein.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="kicker">Fiber, made fun.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="founders-block reveal">
        <p class="section-stamp">Who We Are</p>
        <div class="prose"><p>We're Li and Benson. Two friends, two health-conscious foodies, and two licensed food safety professionals.</p></div>
        <div class="founders-grid">
            <div class="founder-card">
                <div class="founder-initial">L</div>
                <h3 class="founder-name">Li</h3>
                <p class="founder-role">Co-Founder</p>
                <div class="founder-certs"><span class="cert">SQF Practitioner</span><span class="cert">HACCP Certified</span><span class="cert">PCQI</span><span class="cert">FSVP</span><span class="cert">ASQ CMQ-OE</span></div>
                <p class="founder-bio">Nutrition science, food science, food safety. Sees both sides of a label: what it says, and what it means.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="founder-card">
                <div class="founder-initial">B</div>
                <h3 class="founder-name">Benson</h3>
                <p class="founder-role">Co-Founder</p>
                <div class="founder-certs"><span class="cert">SQF Practitioner</span><span class="cert">HACCP Certified</span><span class="cert">PCQI</span><span class="cert">FSVP</span><span class="cert">ServSafe Manager</span></div>
                <p class="founder-bio">Environmental scientist who stumbled into food safety and never left. The reason sustainability is built in, not bolted on.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="name-block reveal">
        <p class="section-stamp">Why GÜTE</p>
        <div class="name-grid">
            <div class="name-card dark">
                <div class="name-word">Güte</div>
                <p class="name-sub">German — "Good"</p>
                <p class="name-desc">Good ingredients. Good process. Good for the planet.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="name-card light">
                <div class="name-word"><em>Gut</em>e</div>
                <p class="name-sub">Right there in the name</p>
                <p class="name-desc">That wasn't an accident. Every bar is built to be gute for your gut.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="product-block reveal">
        <p class="section-stamp">What We Built</p>
        <div class="prose"><p><strong>GÜTE Crunch.</strong> Small-batch, hand-stamped. Every ingredient earns its spot.</p></div>
        <div class="good-grid">
            <div class="good-cell" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(250,245,236,0.58), rgba(250,245,236,0.72)), url('/images/Panel/good-ingredients.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"><div class="good-word">Good <em>ingredients.</em></div><p class="good-detail">Seven ancient grains &amp; seeds. Checked by two people who read labels for a living.</p></div>
            <div class="good-cell" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(250,245,236,0.58), rgba(250,245,236,0.72)), url('/images/Panel/good-gut.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"><div class="good-word">Good for <em>your gut.</em></div><p class="good-detail">10g fiber from six sources: oat bran, green banana, cassava, acacia, apple, psyllium.</p></div>
            <div class="good-cell" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(250,245,236,0.58), rgba(250,245,236,0.72)), url('/images/Panel/plant-protein.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"><div class="good-word">Plant-based <em>protein.</em></div><p class="good-detail">Pea + rice, together. No dairy, no whey.</p></div>
            <div class="good-cell" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(250,245,236,0.58), rgba(250,245,236,0.72)), url('/images/Panel/freeze-dried-fruit.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"><div class="good-word">Real <em>fruit.</em></div><p class="good-detail">Blueberry, cranberry, lemon. No artificial flavoring.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="bridge">
            <div class="bridge-text">
                <p class="bridge-label">Want to see exactly what's in it?</p>
                <p class="bridge-headline">Every ingredient.<br><em>All of them explained.</em></p>
            </div>
            <a href="/ingredients.html" class="bridge-link">See the Ingredients →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cause-block reveal">
        <p class="section-stamp">Good for the Planet</p>
        <ul class="beats">
            <li><span>01</span>Small batches. Less waste.</li>
            <li><span>02</span>100% plant-based.</li>
            <li><span>03</span>Paper packaging that actually recycles.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pull-line">If it doesn't earn its place, <em>it doesn't go in.</em></div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-cta reveal">
        <p class="cta-eyebrow">Reserve / First Batch</p>
        <h2 class="cta-title">Good food.<br><em>No filler.</em></h2>
        <a href="/#reserve" class="cta-btn">Join the Waitlist →</a>
        <p class="cta-sign">— Li &amp; Benson</p>
    </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
